  "body": "Are you looking for a new build in a desirable neighbourhood of Orewa? Is a brand new 4 bedroom home with pool your next upgrade, or downsize? A lock up and leave lifestyle close to the stunning beaches on offer in the Hibiscus Coast? \r\n\r\nSeize the chance to secure a premium house and land package in Ara Hills, to be built by the renowned Dream Concept Homes.  This upcoming residence will feature a well-designed layout with 4 bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms (plus an additional toilet accessed from the exterior to service the pool area), double garage and heated inground concrete pool, perfect for accommodating a modern family. Situated next to a reserve and with elevated views across Ara Hills and beyond, this is living the dream. \r\n\r\nThe gourmet kitchen will be fitted with high-end appliances and complemented by a walk-in pantry, a dream setup for any culinary enthusiast.  The expansive open-plan living and dining area flows effortlessly onto a north-west facing outdoor area with inground pool, ideal for relaxed family moments or entertaining guests.  \r\n\r\nLocated in Ara Hills, this new subdivision combines stunning natural landscapes with carefully planned amenities, providing residents a unique blend of suburban tranquility and convenient city access.\r\n\r\nWith options for turnkey or staged payments, you can lock in this stunning package and have a say in the interior of your home making it customised for your family. If this design doesn't suit, get in touch with our team to design your new family home. \r\n\r\nGet in touch with Sarah today for more information including plans, specifications and to view the section. \r\n\r\nNb: renders are for illustration purposes only and may differ from the actual completed home.",
